# Solana / Anchor build output
# The program crate builds into its own target/ (2 GB locally); Anchor adds
# contracts/solana/target and .anchor when it runs. None of it belongs in git.
contracts/solana/target/
contracts/solana/.anchor/
contracts/solana/node_modules/
contracts/solana/programs/*/target/

# The program keypair Anchor generates. Committing it would publish the key that
# controls program upgrades — see SECURITY_AUDIT.md SOL-12.
**/target/deploy/*-keypair.json
